From: cursor-agent <cursor-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 17:35:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: restore Pages deploy so /FlexAIDdS/ repo stats stay live

Deploy Site was green while thebonhomme.com/FlexAIDdS/ stayed frozen at
2026-07-14: Pages build_type is workflow, so pushing gh-pages never
published, and github-pages environment policy rejects branch main.
Restore deploy-pages without that environment, verify live markers, and
stop the usersite step from rsync --delete of the whole apex tree.
